[V2 THE RATIO FORM -- T_phase/T_bary = m/(mu m_p), with the footing labeled]
  [PASS] V2a EQUAL-SIGMA identity (G151 A3, at sigma = 119.2 km/s): c/a = T_bary/T_phase = mu m_p/m
